    "notes": "Deployments expose min/max instances for autoscaling; API documents rate limits and contact for higher rates, not a fixed new-account GPU/VM allowance. Request-rate increase is distinct from fleet capacity; numeric aggregate quota and review SLA not established. Create-prediction API limited to 600 requests/min (other endpoints 3,000/min); accounts with granted credit and no payment method are limited to 1 req/s, max 6/min; stronger throttling as prepaid credit runs low. Higher limits via support.",
